        "Content": "Visit dngflanaganford.ie to register your interest & to see current offers, or place an offer on this property (please note offers can be placed once your registration has been approved, subject to conditions).\r\n\r\nWe are delighted to present to the market substantial four bedroom detached family home, superbly positioned on a generous, mature site at Cummeen on the Strandhill Road ,one of Sligo s most sought-after residential settings. Set well back from the road within a quiet cul-de-sac, the property enjoys a private, beautifully landscaped garden with an abundance of established shrubs, trees and rose bushes, together with excellent off-street parking to the front.\r\n\r\nThis impressive four-bedroom detached family home extends to approximately 172 sq.m (1,853 sq.ft) and occupies a generous, mature site with beautifully maintained gardens to the front, side and rear. Finished externally with an attractive brick facade and full PVC double glazing throughout, the property is heated by an oil-fired central heating system to wall mounted radiators, and is connected to mains water with a septic tank on site for wastewater treatment. Beautifully mature site of generous gardens and shrubs and trees throughout.\r\n\r\nLocation\r\nThis fine family home is located at Cummeen, on the Strandhill Road (R292), one of Sligo s most established and sought after residential settings. The property sits within a quiet cul de sac, set back from the road, yet enjoys the convenience of being just c. 2km from Sligo Town Centre and c. 6km from the popular seaside village of Strandhill placing it conviently to the vibrant amenities of the town and the coast.\r\n\r\nSize\r\n172 sq.m. / 1,851sq.ft.\r\n\r\nEntrance Porch\r\n7.60m x 2.00m (24.93ft x 6.56ft)\r\nExtensive glazing, sliding patio door entrance, tiled flooring\r\n\r\nEntrance Hall\r\nCirca 16.2 sqm Carpet floors\r\n\r\nLiving Room\r\n5.90m x 4.10m (19.36ft x 13.45ft)\r\nOpen fireplace with back boiler, large east-facing window, French doors to dining room\r\n\r\nDining Room\r\n2.50m x 5.50m (8.20ft x 18.04ft)\r\nMulti-function reception room, carpet flooring, large east-facing window\r\n\r\nKitchen/Dining Room\r\n4.20m x 3.70m (13.78ft x 12.14ft)\r\nFully fitted Shaker-style kitchen, tiled flooring and splashback, private aspect to side garden\r\n\r\nLounge\r\n3.80m x 3.00m (12.47ft x 9.84ft)\r\nAdjacent to kitchen, carpet flooring, open fireplace, east-facing window over side garden\r\n\r\nBedroom 1\r\n4.20m x 3.60m (13.78ft x 11.81ft)\r\nCarpet flooring, wall-to-wall built-in wardrobes, en suite\r\n\r\nEn-suite\r\n1.70m x 1.90m (5.58ft x 6.23ft)\r\nTiled flooring and walls, WC, WHB with vanity unit, corner shower\r\n\r\nBedroom 2\r\n3.30m x 2.70m (10.83ft x 8.86ft)\r\nCarpet flooring, WHB with vanity unit, west-facing aspect over rear garden and patio\r\n\r\nBedroom 3\r\n3.30m x 2.40m (10.83ft x 7.87ft)\r\nSingle bedroom, carpet flooring, built-in wardrobes with fitted WHB, west-facing aspect\r\n\r\nBathroom\r\n2.60m x 2.10m (8.53ft x 6.89ft)\r\nTiled flooring and walls, WC, WHB and bath\r\n\r\nBedroom 4\r\n3.30m x 3.40m (10.83ft x 11.15ft)\r\nCarpet flooring, built-in wardrobes, fitted WHB, west-facing aspect to rear\r\n\r\nRear Porch\r\n2.40m x 1.40m (7.87ft x 4.59ft)\r\nTiled flooring, glazed south-facing patio door to rear patio\r\n\r\nUtility Room\r\n2.50m x 3.00m (8.20ft x 9.84ft)\r\nTiled flooring, built-in units with WHB, fully plumbed for washing machine\r\n\r\nMulti-purpose Room\r\n4.90m x 3.00m (16.08ft x 9.84ft)\r\nCarpet flooring, built-in shelving and bookcasing, south-facing glazed patio door to rear patio. Ideal as a games room or home office.\r\n\r\nGarage\r\nCirca 15.08sqm Double timber garage door to rear, also accessed via the utility room\r\n\r\nDirections: F91 VH51"
